{"data":{"slug":"concentration-of-tournament-success","title":"The Concentration of Tournament Success","research_question":"How concentrated are league titles among teams?","motivation":"Concentration of titles is the long-run counterpart to within-season balance, and a standard lens from industrial organisation (HHI) applied to competitive success.","methodology":["Concentrated quantity: derived titles (winner of the last playoff game of each split).","HHI = sum of squared title shares among title winners; Lorenz curve of title counts.","Leagues with at least 4 splits that have playoff games in the data."],"limitations":["Titles are derived from game records, not an official register; a third-place game played after a final would be mislabelled.","HHI over winners only ignores teams that never won; a league where one team wins every title gives HHI = 1 whatever the number of teams.","Prize money is not in the source data, so prize concentration is not analysed."],"references":["Hirschman, A. O. (1964). The paternity of an index. American Economic Review, 54(5), 761.","Gini, C. (1912). Variabilità e mutabilità. Tipografia di Paolo Cuppini, Bologna.","Sevenhuysen, T. Oracle's Elixir: LoL esports match data. https://oracleselixir.com/tools/downloads"],"status":"completed","status_note":null,"data":{"source":"Oracle's Elixir professional League of Legends match data (yearly CSV files).","files":[{"filename":"2020_LoL_esports_match_data_from_OraclesElixir.csv","sha256":"4c271d944d37","coverage_start":"2020-01-03T07:33:26Z","coverage_end":"2020-12-27T11:06:48Z","rows_accepted":116880},{"filename":"2021_LoL_esports_match_data_from_OraclesElixir.csv","sha256":"bf1b54172f7d","coverage_start":"2021-01-02T07:40:39Z","coverage_end":"2021-12-26T13:22:45Z","rows_accepted":147490},{"filename":"2022_LoL_esports_match_data_from_OraclesElixir.csv","sha256":"76b7cb8afc1c","coverage_start":"2022-01-10T07:44:08Z","coverage_end":"2022-12-27T12:43:43Z","rows_accepted":150228},{"filename